00:20:48.686 --> 00:20:50.771
I thought I was different.

00:20:52.815 --> 00:20:53.816
But...

00:20:55.192 --> 00:20:56.569
Baudelaire...

00:20:57.903 --> 00:20:59.488
The Flowers of Evil...

00:21:00.322 --> 00:21:02.408
Truth is, I don't really understand it.

00:21:04.118 --> 00:21:07.621
I was just in love with myself reading it.

00:21:08.539 --> 00:21:10.624
I was trying to look away

00:21:10.708 --> 00:21:12.042
from who I really am.

00:21:14.253 --> 00:21:15.462
Saeki,

00:21:16.672 --> 00:21:19.008
I wanted you to be an angel forever.

00:21:20.134 --> 00:21:22.386
I didn't want to face

00:21:22.469 --> 00:21:24.346
the actual, real you.

00:21:25.639 --> 00:21:27.766
I can't have a normal relationship,

00:21:27.850 --> 00:21:29.560
but I'm not a pervert, either!

00:21:31.478 --> 00:21:34.648
I can't be the person
that you want me to be, Nakamura.

00:21:35.316 --> 00:21:37.359
I've got no substance.

00:21:38.402 --> 00:21:40.446
I'm just a despicable shit bug!

00:21:43.324 --> 00:21:44.450
I can't choose...

00:21:46.035 --> 00:21:48.662
I don't have the right to choose!

00:21:53.584 --> 00:21:54.627
Fine...

00:21:56.545 --> 00:21:57.630
I'm done.

00:21:58.005 --> 00:21:59.048
THE FLOWERS OF EVIL

00:22:17.441 --> 00:22:19.026
[sobbing quietly]

00:22:20.194 --> 00:22:22.696
[siren blaring]

00:22:30.454 --> 00:22:34.083
-[♪ tense music playing]
-[indistinct chatter over radio]

00:22:48.597 --> 00:22:50.933
TO BE CONTINUED

00:22:51.016 --> 00:22:53.018
[♪ closing theme music playing]

00:23:48.073 --> 00:23:49.158
ON THE NEXT EPISODE

00:23:49.241 --> 00:23:52.661
[narrator] Kasuga and Nakamura
are unable to escape from this town.

00:23:52.745 --> 00:23:56.832
Kasuga ends up
setting foot in the secret garden.

00:23:56.915 --> 00:24:01.336
Next time, on episode five.
Kasuga learns the truth about Nakamura.

00:24:01.420 --> 00:24:03.005
Translated by Yuka Kristi